  "reviewNotes": [
    "All 26 complete teaching units, original cases, tables, reasoning and counterfactuals reviewed independently of their authors.",
    "All 26 production-renderer vector diagrams visually inspected; directions and tissue relationships cross-checked against data descriptors.",
    "Corrected before approval: synechiae at anterior lens surface; empty capsular bag with anterior opening for vitreous prolapse; matched fixed-lens focal distance; pure PED retinal/RPE apposition; positive post-ablation stromal separation; explicit orthogonal Sturm projections.",
    "Schematics are qualitative and non-patient examples. They are not quantitative operative plans or substitutes for clinical imaging.",
    "Evidence review used official pages and relevant primary papers, including abstracts/indexed passages when publisher full text was inaccessible. No assertion that every linked full article was read.",
    "Browser-specific SVG arrowhead rendering remains an integration QA item; the encoded arrow endpoints and intended directions were checked.",
    "2026-11-01: Independently reviewed 20 new BCSC Vol 1 original vector illustrations (atlas-s01-03..22) across all 17 chapters for anatomical/spatial directionality, clinical thresholds, and zero text-bounds clipping.",
    "2026-11-01: Programmatically verified Wave 1A (+11 new 900x460 SVGs atlas-s01-23..28 & atlas-s02-03..07, unitIds inline bindings across S01–S03, 1800px qlmanage raster check, 0 text-box overlaps, 0 textBoundsWarnings).",
    "2026-11-02: Independent attending clinical and 4x Retina WebKit PNG visual audit passed across bcsc-s08..s11 and all 32 Wave 3 diagrams (atlas-s08-03..10, atlas-s09-03..10, atlas-s10-03..10, atlas-s11-03..10): verified zero clipped characters, zero line-through-text or label overlaps after 10 targeted coordinate/padding refinements, and 100% accuracy across corneal/uveitis/glaucoma/cataract landmark trials, drug contraindications, biometry/optical rules, and BCSC PDF/printed page citations.",
    "2026-11-02 targeted correction, not a full re-review: atlas-s08-03 (FECD posterior depression, Sun 2019), atlas-s08-08 (Mooren topical corticosteroids) and atlas-s10-10 (staging labels aligned with BCSC Section 10). Hashes refreshed for these three units only."
